WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:08.677
The Six to Ten of Swords carry the suit of thought through transition,
secrecy, feeling trapped, worry and the end of a hard stretch.

00:00:09.977 --> 00:00:10.930
Six of Swords.

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:13.927
Transition, moving on, leaving rough
waters.

00:00:13.927 --> 00:00:22.713
In RWS, a ferryman poles a boat carrying a covered figure and a child
across water, with six swords standing upright in the boat.

00:00:24.013 --> 00:00:25.023
Seven of Swords.

00:00:25.023 --> 00:00:27.043
Strategy, stealth, acting alone.

00:00:27.043 --> 00:00:31.966
A figure tiptoes away from a camp carrying
five swords and leaving two behind.

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:35.755
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:35.755 --> 00:00:40.599
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
